3085 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Project Overview\nObjective\072 To strategically collaborate with tech and executive teams to improve the Hello Molly e\055commerce platform\056\nKey Focus Areas\072\n1\056 Fresh Interface Design\072\n\042 Develop a modern\054 user\055friendly interface that showcases Hello Molly\031s product range effectively\056\n2\056 Feature Enhancements\072\n\042 Contextual Search\072 Improve the search functionality to provide more relevant results based on user behaviour and preferences\056\n\042 Wishlist Capabilities\072 Implement a feature that allows users to save their favourite items for future purchases\056\n\042 User Profiles\072 Enhance user profiles to provide a personalised shopping experience\056\n3\056 Data Collection Improvements\072\n\042 Strengthen methods for collecting user data to better understand customer preferences and improve overall service\056\nExpected Outcomes\072\n\042 A more engaging user experience\056\n\042 Increased user satisfaction and retention\056\n\042 Better insights into customer behaviour to drive future improvements\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 3086 0 R
     /Pg 500 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

