3223 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I am a seasoned Product Designer specialising in creating user\055centric experiences where creativity\054 data\054 and AI converge to drive innovation\056 I believe great design is not just about aesthetics\024it transforms how people interact with technology\054 influences behaviour\054 and shapes the perception of brands and businesses\056\nMotivated by learning\054 mentoring\054 and collaborating\054 I empower teams to push the boundaries of UX innovation\056 \nI strive to refine the creative process by integrating human\055centred design thinking with data insights and AI\055driven tools\054 enabling faster\054 smarter decision\055making that elevates both user and business outcomes\056\n\n\050IDEAS  DATA  AI\055ENABLED DESIGN  USER\055CENTRICITY\n\n\nI work at the intersection of strategy\054 design\054 and technology\024bridging the gap between design\054 development\054 business\054 and users\056 By leveraging data analytics and AI\055powered solutions throughout the design lifecycle\054 I unlock new opportunities to solve complex problems and drive measurable impact\056\nThroughout my career\054 I\031ve helped deliver transformative digital experiences for some of Australia\031s most recognised brands\054 including Foxtel\054 SBS\054 Vodafone\054 Woolworths\054 News Corp\054 Ticketek\054 Service NSW\054 GrainCorp\054 THE ICONIC\054 and others\056\nMy goal is simple\072 to produce meaningful work that exceeds expectations\024creating lasting value for users\054 businesses\054 and society through creativity\054 empathy\054 and the smart application of technology\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 3224 0 R
     /Pg 3078 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

